<title>UK: TABLE - Somerfield yr pretax profits rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Somerfield yr pretax profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending April 26</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 29.4		  vs    29.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   6.8		  vs     N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  10.2		  vs     N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     105.4		  vs    92.0</p>
<p> Turnover		 3,200.6		  vs 3,161.0</p>
<p>NOTE - EPS is on basic basis -- the prior period is not comparable in all respects as a result of the capital reconstruction that took place prior to and on its flotation in August 1996. EPS on pro forma basis was 26.6 pence versus 21.8 pence.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 101.9 and 105 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Somerfield Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
